>no </span><span begin="03:52.326" end="03:52.500">mo </span><span begin="03:52.500" end="03:52.789">to </span><span begin="03:52.789" end="03:53.091">e</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-a52bad6b-e989-4e37-b559-d554f37d3d1f">(<span begin="03:50.540" end="03:50.877">ki </span><span begin="03:50.877" end="03:51.092">se </span><span begin="03:51.092" end="03:51.248">ki </span><span begin="03:51.248" end="03:51.461">wa </span><span begin="03:51.461" end="03:51.617">wa </span><span begin="03:51.617" end="03:51.735">ta </span><span begin="03:51.735" end="03:52.161">shi </span><span begin="03:52.161" end="03:52.326">no </span><span begin="03:52.326" end="03:52.500">mo </span><span begin="03:52.500" end="03:52.789">to </span><span begin="03:52.789" end="03:53.091">e</span>)</span></text><text for="0e707785-fe50-4f1e-a58c-b8829dde6a3c"><span begin="03:53.334" end="03:53.535">ha </span><span begin="03:53.535" end="03:53.723">ji </span><span begin="03:53.723" end="03:53.918">ma </span><span begin="03:53.918" end="03:54.232">ru </span><span begin="03:54.232" end="03:54.447">u </span><span begin="03:54.447" end="03:54.595">n </span><span begin="03:54.595" end="03:54.893">me </span><span begin="03:54.893" end="03:55.119">i </span><span begin="03:55.119" end="03:55.719">ni</span></text><text for="line-e2fe35d5-4731-4ce0-b00e-5f9d3db4c9e5"><span begin="03:55.963" end="03:56.114">ke </span><span begin="03:56.114" end="03:56.454">tsu </span><span begin="03:56.667" end="03:56.851">i </span><span begin="03:56.851" end="03:57.305">to </span><span begin="03:57.389" end="03:57.546">ka </span><span begin="03:57.546" end="03:58.088">ku </span><span begin="03:58.088" end="03:58.251">go </span><span begin="03:58.251" end="03:58.593">no </span><span begin="03:58.924" end="03:59.147">ryo </span><span begin="03:59.147" end="03:59.294">u </span><span begin="03:59.294" end="03:59.490">yo </span><span begin="03:59.490" end="03:59.662">ku </span><span begin="03:59.662" end="04:00.015">de</span></text><text for="3f2ec2c5-6e00-4bd3-a372-3b61dc2bf6f2"><span begin="04:00.160" end="04:00.511">no </span><span begin="04:00.511" end="04:00.695">zo </span><span begin="04:00.695" end="04:00.859">mu </span><span begin="04:00.859" end="04:01.045">mi </span><span begin="04:01.045" end="04:01.256">ra </span><span begin="04:01.256" end="04:01.365">i </span><span begin="04:01.365" end="04:01.726">ma </span><span begin="04:01.726" end="04:03.331">de</span></text><text for="line-200bac58-8283-4a92-a105-0109309f4312"><span begin="04:04.509" end="04:04.734">ha </span><span begin="04:04.734" end="04:04.874">ba </span><span begin="04:04.874" end="04:05.028">ta </span><span begin="04:05.028" end="04:05.244">ki </span><span begin="04:05.244" end="04:05.547">wa</span></text><text for="36568914-c410-4b7c-9eba-d73441f46817"><span begin="04:05.698" end="04:05.871">sho </span><span begin="04:05.871" end="04:06.108">u </span><span begin="04:06.108" end="04:06.298">ri </span><span begin="04:06.298" end="04:06.456">wo </span><span begin="04:06.456" end="04:06.624">mo </span><span begin="04:06.624" end="04:06.947">ta </span><span begin="04:06.947" end="04:07.222">ra </span><span begin="04:07.222" end="04:07.313">shi </span><span begin="04:07.313" end="04:09.919">te</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="line-954e423f-a509-4f3d-ac75-1827e6f2a762">残酷的命运之下</text><text for="22d10ddd-8eb0-460b-b4cc-18f65d0d9d99">未晓的黑夜之中</text><text for="line-c5047240-e963-4c65-b3f9-5f3e38fc0f37">梦想决不会被蒙尘</text><text for="line-8b732541-6a9d-42f5-a1a2-02b335e490bc">救赎于正义中</text><text for="436e2b52-0be1-4e7a-82ff-73fcb2ab3b73">将悲愁斩断</text><text for="line-89540667-433b-4fef-8769-69d3597cbdb8">向不容失败的战斗</text><text for="line-98450865-3698-4eb3-9759-a2776d46894a">高举见证</text><text for="6ae870cd-b445-4b5a-b14b-c93b28f87792">心与</text><text for="6ae870cd-b445-4b5a-b14b-c93b28f87792"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="6ae870cd-b445-4b5a-b14b-c93b28f87792-bg">(以无尽想象)</span></text><text for="77e727fb-6e89-4d36-b5bf-f866d5571fa5">心</text><text for="77e727fb-6e89-4d36-b5bf-f866d5571fa5"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="77e727fb-6e89-4d36-b5bf-f866d5571fa5-bg">(交叠在一起的)</span></text><text for="line-ac0f6c73-f739-4ccc-9045-a7baf738b55e">在纯白的引领下</text><text for="a8937438-2dc9-4178-8ff1-817b6b953cb8">舞台拉开帷幕</text><text for="d125691c-8209-45a3-96b6-0c49f1cc2149">前进</text><text for="d125691c-8209-45a3-96b6-0c49f1cc2149"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="d125691c-8209-45a3-96b6-0c49f1cc2149-bg">(前进)</span></text><text for="line-ee0011e1-ac0b-450f-8355-296d94bd60be">站起来！</text><text for="line-896f851c-f84d-471b-954a-ae0b01203a74">哪怕仅存一丝光亮</text><text for="050d63b4-1cf2-4309-bb9a-2039463d57a8">都要直到最后的最后</text><text for="line-1f6a1737-b358-4658-b833-abbe9fd3507f">不断伸出手</text><text for="line-27f551d4-a7d2-4bcb-b1f9-1cb6a5bcbeaf">讴歌着不言放弃</text><text for="line-ecfbd156-a5d5-45e8-8314-ad809143636a">奇迹一定会降临</text><text for="line-b68ba2ec-5e8d-4f99-8009-150a30dc83af">在我们的面前</text><text for="line-c9fc8042-3cb0-4a68-943c-705763bd3e8f">以决心和觉悟的双翼</text><text for="0625cefa-3356-4990-8d17-369f0b3d9875">直至希冀的未来</text><text for="0625cefa-3356-4990-8d17-369f0b3d9875"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="0625cefa-3356-4990-8d17-369f0b3d9875-bg">(我决不会死，我决不会死！)</span></text><text for="line-6de8b2b4-f1ae-4f7c-b05d-a9dc5db7462c">振翅高飞</text><text for="eba3aa92-0436-4d09-ae94-4476f0cf724e">带来胜利</text><text for="line-da8370bb-0ab1-4c3d-b924-54fa397529c2">不公的世界之中</text><text for="6893ac3c-73fc-491a-a7d1-fe6b90fc1d98">摇曳的灯火之下</text><text for="line-8acedf1e-674a-4ff5-bba0-2bde1ec9ec44">竭尽全力做力所能及之事</text><text for="line-3d860ddf-5e14-4754-9c7d-a7d03d3e0b35">翻越枝叶</text><text for="6767642c-7eba-44ca-a5f1-1373512ae396">凭借无数次祈祷</text><text for="line-346c0936-084b-41ae-a2b4-b331d1ae2a11">温柔推动后背的</text><text for="line-a0446d8a-952a-43b7-b767-9852f2ed3a9e">是对你的思念</text><text for="1728d493-0426-4fe7-911a-92b482415241">我与</text><text for="1728d493-0426-4fe7-911a-92b482415241"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="1728d493-0426-4fe7-911a-92b482415241-bg">(以可能性)</span></text><text for="08dee8d4-a2b9-4b78-92f3-18d2abe84127">我</text><text for="08dee8d4-a2b9-4b78-92f3-18d2abe84127"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="08dee8d4-a2b9-4b78-92f3-18d2abe84127-bg">(编织而成的)</span></text><text for="line-0c4a392c-a2cc-4049-ac5f-8199f00a111f">哪怕希望会被</text><text for="2923c47f-a306-41b8-bc9b-9f6ee81063f7">无数次地击碎</text><text for="324be49d-a444-464c-8243-b2d39fa1c04d">进攻</text><text for="324be49d-a444-464c-8243-b2d39fa1c04d"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="324be49d-a444-464c-8243-b2d39fa1c04d-bg">(进攻)</span></text><text for="line-db97c1a3-65ae-435f-b8a5-90fddd92f569">站起来！</text><text for="line-25df158b-7408-4d4d-ad29-ee9762b2d184">高举不容退让的夙愿</text><text for="line-5a592371-95fc-4fe2-a9fc-199da9da4dd9">光芒愈发璀璨夺目</text><text for="line-5c14e9b4-aebc-45b2-bc58-e66ade1ca645">从天而降</text><text for="line-6c80b01b-a1f4-4cac-996f-9f771ec3ef70">只为改变命运</text><text for="line-753691e6-f4b9-4d45-aebc-3e96006c95a7">绝不会结束的我自己</text><text for="line-589bac56-5901-45c9-bd43-db01157272e3">作为领路人将尽情翱翔</text><text for="line-c058dfc9-6e17-4d5b-9412-2c141f650e44">以高高挥舞的意志和</text><text for="line-e75784c2-108e-4f6e-8794-5a4b4fd0cab8">不畏失败的勇气</text><text for="line-e75784c2-108e-4f6e-8794-5a4b4fd0cab8"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-e75784c2-108e-4f6e-8794-5a4b4fd0cab8-bg">(继续前进，继续前进！)</span></text><text for="line-a0c64654-ee8c-4b47-92ab-975bbb0f190b">色彩永远不会褪去</text><text for="line-49daffe4-ec8a-494e-a22a-61ecf63410e6">如果是为了你的话 所有</text><text for="line-b2648a9a-5385-4265-9b6a-38aaae3b6b0d">任何事</text><text for="line-b2648a9a-5385-4265-9b6a-38aaae3b6b0d"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-b2648a9a-5385-4265-9b6a-38aaae3b6b0d-bg">(都能够做到)</span></text><text for="line-1c617846-4d49-4569-83e4-3ee8163aead6">如此一直相信</text><text for="line-a74ced92-4c1e-447c-aafe-ab6d6fd0dda4">只有经历过伤痛</text><text for="af0a24b1-1ff3-4891-bbcb-6531b8631446">才会变得坚强</text><text for="f40d5c71-e365-4a98-a8e5-f3c8be370f63">出现</text><text for="f40d5c71-e365-4a98-a8e5-f3c8be370f63"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="f40d5c71-e365-4a98-a8e5-f3c8be370f63-bg">(出现)</span></text><text for="line-0b0c6c9d-5b2b-49df-a9b5-28dd4596a8c3">站起来！</text><text for="line-0663cdec-6a35-454e-8b1f-fd2e0d11daf0">不论历经怎样的绝望</text><text for="line-e48f2af9-8574-4eec-918f-dae46e0e2984">都要直到最后的最后</text><text for="line-d190d9cb-5a24-46ce-8792-27d7efe0f444">一定会实现</text><text for="line-f50dad57-4733-4677-8add-e3c01f7aec8d">这份耀眼不会消失</text><text for="line-d45affc4-0c40-4db1-84c3-bdcc0f0effc9">奇迹来到我身旁</text><text for="0e707785-fe50-4f1e-a58c-b8829dde6a3c">朝着即将开始的命运</text><text for="line-e2fe35d5-4731-4ce0-b00e-5f9d3db4c9e5">以决心和觉悟的双翼</text><text for="3f2ec2c5-6e00-4bd3-a372-3b61dc2bf6f2">直至希冀的未来</text><text for="3f2ec2c5-6e00-4bd3-a372-3b61dc2bf6f2"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="3f2ec2c5-6e00-4bd3-a372-3b61dc2bf6f2-bg">(我决不会死，我决不会死！)</span></text><text for="line-200bac58-8283-4a92-a105-0109309f4312">振翅高飞</text><text for="36568914-c410-4b7c-9eba-d73441f46817">带来胜利</text><text for="line-896f851c-f84d-471b-954a-ae0b01203a74"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-1871c397-26d8-4e90-8daf-ffc0c7aa574f">(哪怕仅存一丝光亮)</span></text><text for="line-ecfbd156-a5d5-45e8-8314-ad809143636a"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-0ca33ebc-d0a7-4588-8bbe-733b0752ac14">(奇迹一定会降临)</span></text><text for="line-25df158b-7408-4d4d-ad29-ee9762b2d184"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-9c4e440b-d232-4f0c-94a7-9ccc230993e8">(高举不容退让的夙愿)</span></text><text for="line-753691e6-f4b9-4d45-aebc-3e96006c95a7"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-bfdf7a71-e04c-4a71-98ea-092d277989c3">(绝不会结束的我自己)</span></text><text for="line-d45affc4-0c40-4db1-84c3-bdcc0f0effc9"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-a52bad6b-e989-4e37-b559-d554f37d3d1f">(奇迹来到我身旁)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:10.157"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-954e423f-a509-4f3d-ac75-1827e6f2a762" itunes:key="line-954e423f-a509-4f3d-ac75-1827e6f2a762" begin="00:33.3